VENDORED SOURCE CODE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/coros/md5.ts contains the MD5 implementation from the Deno standard
library, copied in full in Pinta365/coros and modified only in formatting,
exported wrappers, and a narrowed parameter type. MD5 has no Web Crypto
equivalent, so a userland implementation is required.

Source: deno_std 0.160.0, hash/md5.ts
        https://deno.land/std@0.160.0/hash/md5.ts

